Changes made in Bookmania
-------------------------

Bookmania changed Yōkai's files and added its own. The complete list of changes
is in the git history of this repository; the files of Yōkai that were changed
can be listed with:

  git diff --name-status 843a59b -- . ':!docs'

The main changes:

  - A new reader for text ebooks (EPUB, MOBI, AZW3): the module core/ebook, the
    package yokai.ebook in app/, and the reader in app/src/main/assets/ebook.
    It typesets vertical and horizontal text, one or two columns, with
    settings at three levels, imported fonts, and reading positions.
  - Page turn animations (yokai.pageturn) and the fold's shadow between two
    columns or two pages (yokai.gutter), for the text and the comic readers.
  - Its own identity: the name Bookmania, the application id
    io.github.n09527.bookmania, the icons, and version numbers from 1.0.0.
  - Removed from Yōkai: Firebase crash reporting and analytics, Yōkai's build
    flavors and release channels, and its self-update source.

